    "source": "worked by hand in M35 P9, the M35 plan's call 8, against crates/storage's M35 P7 stamping and set_intent; bundle.set_intent and args.intent are the Rust runner's (crates/core/src/storage_family.rs) and have no twin in frozen Python's _op_table",
